{
  "name": "YC Startups + B2B Email & Tech Stack Enrichment (Apify)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Y Combinator Startups + B2B Email & Tech Stack Enrichment\nPowered by **Mehdad DataLabs** on Apify:\n1. YC Scraper: https://apify.com/mehdad-datalabs/y-combinator-yc-startup-directory-b2b-lead-scraper\n2. B2B Enricher: https://apify.com/mehdad-datalabs/b2b-website-email-phone-social-links-tech-stack-scraper\n\nPulls YC startups, filters companies with live websites, enriches emails/tech stack, and routes qualified leads to Google Sheets.",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "8dd441b3-4a32-4a24-995f-02fac3ed9b2b",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Step 1: Set YC Batch & Credentials\nIn **Set YC Batch & Config**, replace:\n- `apifyToken`: `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN`\n- `spreadsheetId`: `YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID`\n- `batch`: e.g. `W25`, `S25`, or `W26`",
        "height": 210,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "6d1d662f-3fce-4a96-afea-1197fd2a3cac",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        700,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Step 2: B2B Website Enrichment\nCaps batch size with **Limit Startups** and calls the Apify B2B Website Enricher for emails, phones, social links, and tech stack.",
        "height": 190,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "65eb5be9-86e8-41bc-8f23-dce073bb4fd2",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Enrichment",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1240,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Step 3: Lead Quality Split\n- **QualifiedLeads Tab:** Startups with verified contact email\n- **NeedsReview Tab:** Startups without email (social/website only)",
        "height": 190,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "896d82a9-5759-443d-a803-afea689276a7",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Lead Routing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1760,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
